  "implementation": [
    "Before any project install, capture private bound send/close, URL revoke, and the bootstrap timers; all private port sends use the closure.",
    "Only the main panel enables the new broker liveness option; legacy/default brokers do not send pings.",
    "After ready, at most one exact nonce/type challenge is pending; response uses the original private port.",
    "An exact matching pong must arrive before the monotonic 3-second deadline; valid acknowledgment schedules the next ping after 1 second.",
    "Timeout closes and invalidates the original broker before the panel removes its frame and latches the package; explicit Retry is required.",
    "Close clears both timers and pending nonce; late/duplicate/stale responses do not revive a session.",
    "No request ID or read/write authority is added by liveness."
  ],
